 Broadcast server;tick;clients;i;old;data
⍝ Every second, send every connected client a "price" event for each symbol, and every 5 seconds a "news" event
⍝ server - the Jarvis server
⍝ Runs in its own thread, started by Run3, until Stop sets Running to 0. Not an endpoint (see IncludeFns in Run3).
⍝ Symbols, Prices, Headlines, and Running are variables in this namespace (#.Ex3), set by Run3.
 tick←0
 :While Running
     ⎕DL 1
     tick+←1
     :Trap 0 ⍝ nothing else catches an error in this thread: report it and carry on
         clients←server.SSEConnections'Ticker' ⍝ everyone connected to /Ticker right now
         :For i :In ⍳≢Symbols
             old←i⊃Prices
             Prices[i]←0.01×⌊0.5+old×100+0.01×¯101+?201 ⍝ move by up to 1% either way, rounded to cents
             data←⎕NS''
             data.(symbol price change)←(i⊃Symbols)(i⊃Prices)(0.01×⌊0.5+100×(i⊃Prices)-old)
⍝ v20: data←⎕NS'' ⋄ data ⎕VSET ('symbol' (i⊃Symbols))('price' (i⊃Prices))('change' (0.01×⌊0.5+100×(i⊃Prices)-old))
             clients server.SendSSE'price'server.FormatSSE data
         :EndFor
         :If 0=5|tick
             data←⎕NS''
             data.text←(?≢Headlines)⊃Headlines
⍝ v20: data←(text: (?≢Headlines)⊃Headlines)
             clients server.SendSSE'news'server.FormatSSE data
         :EndIf
     :Else
         ⎕←'Broadcast: ',⎕DMX.EM,(0<≢⎕DMX.Message)/': ',⎕DMX.Message
     :EndTrap
 :EndWhile
